#ASSERT `Can the deceased's document be their will` `as the will-maker` `an unasked date` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Can the deceased's document be their will` `as the witness` `an unasked date` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

-- Was the deceased's will valid
-- Graham's will (c087), a witness taking a gift: valid; Giuseppe's (d074), one witness but by the law where the land is, as to the land: valid; a will made at 17, even with the Court satisfied: not (s 7); an unsigned document of an adult, the Court satisfied: valid (s 32).
#ASSERT `Was the deceased's will valid` `as the beneficiary or family` (Date 2 5 1970) (Date 1 6 2040) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE 2 0 TRUE `none of these` FALSE (Date 19 8 2052) FALSE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Was the deceased's will valid` `as the beneficiary or family` (Date 2 5 1970) (Date 1 6 2040) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE 2 0 TRUE `none of these` FALSE (Date 19 8 2052) FALSE EQUALS `yes if` (`Is my will valid` (Date 2 5 1970) (Date 1 6 2040) (`the signing from` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE 2 0 TRUE TRUE) (`the route from` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) FALSE TRUE (Date 19 8 2052) FALSE)
#ASSERT `Was the deceased's will valid` `as the beneficiary or family` (Date 14 2 1968) (Date 1 6 2040) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE 1 0 TRUE `as to land or a building, it conforms to the law of where the land or building is (s 20(2)(b))` FALSE (Date 3 11 2052) FALSE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Was the deceased's will valid` `as the beneficiary or family` (Date 14 2 1968) (Date 1 6 2040) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE 1 0 TRUE `as to land or a building, it conforms to the law of where the land or building is (s 20(2)(b))` FALSE (Date 3 11 2052) FALSE EQUALS `yes if` (`Is my will valid` (Date 14 2 1968) (Date 1 6 2040) (`the signing from` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE 1 0 TRUE FALSE) (`the route from` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 3 11 2052) FALSE)
#ASSERT `Was the deceased's will valid` `as the beneficiary or family` (Date 14 2 1968) (Date 1 6 2040) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE 1 0 TRUE `none of these` FALSE (Date 3 11 2052) FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Was the deceased's will valid` `as the beneficiary or family` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 13 3 2021) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE `none of these` FALSE (Date 19 8 2052) TRUE EQUALS no
