#ASSERT `Was the deceased's will valid` `as the will-maker` `an unasked date` `an unasked date` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked number` `an unasked number` `an unasked fact` `an unasked route` `an unasked fact` `an unasked date` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
